{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“定态 Schrödinger 方程”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"定态Schrödinger方程"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>定态 Schrödinger 方程求的是 Hamilton 量的特征向量.</p>\n"}}